  {"section":"8.3.1","page":133,"text":"An bhfaca tú mo mhálasa?"},
  {"section":"8.3.1","page":133,"text":"Cad a tharla dár mbronntanaisne?"},
  {"section":"8.3.1","page":133,"text":"Chaill siad a gcluichesean."},
